{"unit_id":"snanjib__DSH-minesweeper#feature-1","repo":"snanjib/DSH-minesweeper","commit":"3e5118f410f1a227f79fa6db5705fb9d43865a38","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Minesweeper 的功能「扫雷棋盘」：首次翻格时布雷并保护首格及周围格，可选择预设或自定义棋盘，翻格、标记并追踪雷数和用时。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.template.js:6-10","client.template.js:54-83","client.template.js:124-204","client.template.js:1393-1396"]}
{"unit_id":"snanjib__DSH-minesweeper#feature-2","repo":"snanjib/DSH-minesweeper","commit":"3e5118f410f1a227f79fa6db5705fb9d43865a38","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Minesweeper 的功能「快速翻开」：在已翻开的数字格周围标记数与数字相同后触发，自动翻开其余未标格；可用鼠标或设置的按键触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.template.js:170-204","client.template.js:1036-1077"]}
{"unit_id":"snanjib__DSH-minesweeper#feature-3","repo":"snanjib/DSH-minesweeper","commit":"3e5118f410f1a227f79fa6db5705fb9d43865a38","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Minesweeper 的功能「鲸鱼娘选格提示」：点击随机选按钮后短暂显示提示，再从优先候选格中随机标出一格，方便玩家决定下一步。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.template.js:443-479","client.template.js:1201-1211"]}
{"unit_id":"snanjib__DSH-minesweeper#feature-4","repo":"snanjib/DSH-minesweeper","commit":"3e5118f410f1a227f79fa6db5705fb9d43865a38","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Minesweeper 的功能「安全格提示」：点击安全格按钮后，按已知数字约束推理并回溯枚举，找到必定安全的未翻格时将其标出；无确定解时会说明推不出。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.template.js:264-437","client.template.js:543-549","client.template.js:1214-1223"]}
